/** * Executes the primary effect of this spell when targeting a creature. * *
This method is called when the spell successfully completes casting on a creature target. * By default, it delegates to the parent class implementation but can be overridden to provide * custom spell effects. * *
Thread Safety: This method may be called concurrently from multiple threads, * so implementations should avoid modifying shared state without proper synchronization. * * @param castSkill the skill used to cast this spell * @param power the power level of the spell (0.0 to 100.0) * @param performer the creature casting the spell * @param target the creature target of the spell * @since 1.0.0 */
